/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]habit and no data written that the vault already keeps.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim] Counts: [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]6[dim][/bold #D7AFFF] phases[dim][/dim] · [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]6[dim][/bold #D7AFFF] waves[/dim]\n[dim]   Path: [#87AFFF][/dim]plan:202610/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]daily_stats.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim]   Bead: [#87AFFF][/dim]bob-cli-6l[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Page: [#87AFFF][/dim]https://github.com/bobs-org/bob-cli--beads/blob/main/pages/bob-cli-6l/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]README.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim]  1 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Start the clock — the review journal writer[/bold #D7AFFF]                   [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]journal[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]journal: bob-ledger-tools gains api.stats v1 (serialized append queue) [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]and bob-navigation-hotkeys journals every counted ]s answer to per-host [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]monthly JSONL under .bob/stats/review/; the vault allowlists the files; [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]bob-cli gains docs/stats.md with the journal contract and shared [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]vectors.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  2 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]The stats engine in bob-cli[/bold #D7AFFF]                                   [bold white on #D75F87] large  [/bold white on #D75F87]\n    [#AF87FF]engine[dim] · [dim][/dim]after journal[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]engine: single-pass stats index, metric registry with built-ins written [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]as config entries, the stats: config section, six metric kinds, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]ranges/grouping/summaries/display strings, and a golden fixture vault, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]exposed as one compute() returning the schema-1 JSON model.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  3 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]The bob stats command[/bold #D7AFFF]                                         [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]cli[dim] · [dim][/dim]after engine[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]cli: register bob stats (overview default, show, metrics) in Daily [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]workflow with human, json, and csv output, the colored terminal glance [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]and detail charts, help/completion/README wiring, and real-vault parity [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]tests.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  4 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Obsidian Stats page — data path, tiles, and table[/bold #D7AFFF]             [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]page[dim] · [dim][/dim]after cli[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]page: bob-ledger-tools api.stats v2 spawns bob stats with [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]stale-while-revalidate caching, the bob-stats block renders the header, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]range controls, tile row, table view, and every honest state; the vault [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]gains dash_stats.md, the dash entry point, the weekly-prune link, and [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]Open Stats.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  5 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Obsidian Stats page — focus chart, context panels, and [/bold #D7AFFF]       [bold white on #D75F87] large  [/bold white on #D75F87]\n      [bold #D7AFFF]interaction[/bold #D7AFFF]\n    [#AF87FF]charts[dim] · [dim][/dim]after page[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]charts: hand-rolled SVG focus chart with rolling median, normal band, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]today/missing marks and prior ticks; per-family context panels (themes, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]flow, review, calendar and chore grids); day drill-down, tooltips, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]keyboard, definition popover, and a rendered light/dark preview check.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  6 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Rollout — real-vault verification, docs, and memory[/bold #D7AFFF]           [bold black on #87D7FF] small  [/bold black on #87D7FF]\n    [#AF87FF]rollout[dim] · [dim][/dim]after charts[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]rollout: verify end to end on the live vault and every installed [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]surface, record measured performance, finish docs and README [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]cross-links, apply only the accepted memory decisions, and record [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]follow-ups.[/#D7D7AF]","clan_tribe":"epic","epic_bead_id":"bob-cli-6l","llm_provider":"codex","model":"gpt-6-luna","patch_name":"gh_bobs-org__bob-cli","phase_bead_id":"bob-cli-6l.1","reasoning_effort":"xhigh","vcs_provider":"GitHub"},"source_run_id":"run-8dbfb3d56637cc6783a5875037fb405f","started_at":"2026-10-11T11:02:30.073760+00:00","state":"active"},{"capabilities":{"durably_revivable":true,"historically_viewable":true,"missing_requirements":[],"restartable":true},"commits":[],"dismissed_at":null,"files":{"commits":{"digest":"762a7db32f9eb3f109deebcdc5e70bd6f6f5ab77818de22ef32b8171f27469e3","path":"agents/bbugyi200.apollo.bob-cli-6l.2/commits.json","size_bytes":89},"meta":{"digest":"e37300a2c0d32b4cdb503be08140c481a5e817e13e1d7657d7eca6b5760173a2","path":"agents/bbugyi200.apollo.bob-cli-6l.2/meta.json","size_bytes":685},"prompt":{"digest":"84cd024946f1d75d93f55d4060b69e61a1b86d35dd97789e03386a885a4f85c6","path":"agents/bbugyi200.apollo.bob-cli-6l.2/prompt.md","size_bytes":181},"state":{"digest":"9f1a99e8563d0e0bf864a86d6595856ac6eb8aa6334b71122a93e90b3114eee5","path":"agents/bbugyi200.apollo.bob-cli-6l.2/state.json","size_bytes":163}},"finished_at":null,"global_name":"bbugyi200.apollo.bob-cli-6l.2","local_name":"bob-cli-6l.2","metadata":{"agent_clan":"bob-cli-6l","agent_clan_generation":"20261011070137","bead_id":"bob-cli-6l.2","changespec_name":"gh_bobs-org__bob-cli","cl_name":"gh_bobs-org__bob-cli","clan_tribe":"epic","epic_bead_id":"bob-cli-6l","llm_provider":"grok","model":"grok-4.7","patch_name":"gh_bobs-org__bob-cli","phase_bead_id":"bob-cli-6l.2","reasoning_effort":"xhigh","vcs_provider":"GitHub","wait_for_beads":["bob-cli-6l.1"]},"source_run_id":"ru